  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is (i) to increase access to safely managed water supply and sanitation services in selected rural areas and small towns, and to strengthen national and local institutional capacity for water supply and sanitation service delivery; and (ii) in case of an Eligible Crisis or Emergency, respond promptly and effectively to it.</narrative>
